{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     footer/links — Ghost's SECONDARY navigation, whole and flat.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     Rendered through partials/navigation.hbs with type="secondary".

     Same "-" convention, but here a child is only indented. A footer is
     already a list of everything; hiding part of it behind a disclosure
     removes the one thing a footer is for.

     Every destination that lives inside a dropdown in the top bar should also
     appear here. That is what keeps the bar's JavaScript optional rather than
     load-bearing.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
<ul>
    {{~#foreach navigation}}
        <li{{#match label "~^" "-"}} class="ns-footer__sub"{{/match}}><a href="{{url absolute="true"}}">{{> "navbar/label"}}</a></li>
    {{~/foreach~}}
</ul>
